Install:
  ./install.sh              # ~/.local/bin
  ./install.sh /usr/local

Need Node.js on PATH. panc is not gcc. panpy is not CPython.
Default: panc file.c runs the extract. -o emits WASM. --native is host cc.

Manual: MANUAL.md (every binary, language, issuing-body suite, gap).
